Hinglish / Roman Urdu transliteration data and rules (app/captions/hinglish/: dict.js, urdu.js, translit.js) and the
test cases in tools/hindi-cases.cjs.

Original work written for KBB Studio in November 2026 from general knowledge of everyday Hindi and Urdu and of how
both are typed in Roman letters on social media. No corpus, word-frequency list, dictionary or transliteration table
was copied.

